# rclone filters for sync-gdrive-enseirb: a whitelist.
#
# ~/sync-enseirb holds data science and course projects, which are mostly made of things
# that must not travel: virtual environments, model weights, datasets, build
# output. Listing what to refuse never ends, so this lists what to accept and
# refuses the rest.
#
# A file that is filtered out is not deleted anywhere. It simply stays on the
# machine it is on.
#
# The first matching rule wins, so the order is: directories to skip whatever
# they hold, then secrets, then the accepted extensions, then "nothing else".
# Matching ignores case (sync-gdrive-enseirb passes --ignore-case), and sync-gdrive-enseirb
# caps every file at MAX_SIZE on top of this.
#
# To change the list on one machine, copy this file to
# ~/.config/sync-gdrive-enseirb/filters. sync-gdrive-enseirb notices the change and resyncs.

# --- Directories never synced ---
# .git: a repository is synced by pushing it, and half synced git objects
# corrupt it. The sources inside the repository still travel.
- .git/**
- node_modules/**
- .venv/**
- venv/**
- env/**
- __pycache__/**
- .ipynb_checkpoints/**
- .mypy_cache/**
- .pytest_cache/**
- .ruff_cache/**
- .cache/**
- build/**
- dist/**
- target/**
- wandb/**
- mlruns/**
- checkpoints/**
- .idea/**
- .vscode/**

# --- Opting a directory out by its name ---
# A git repository is synced by pushing it. With .git skipped and the sources
# synced, the other machine sees them as uncommitted changes and refuses to
# pull. Name the directory tps-git or free-tps and nothing in it travels,
# at any depth.
- *-git/**
- free-*/**
# Summer exercises, of no use on the other machines.
- /s9/summer/**

# --- Secrets, even though their extension would pass ---
- .env
- .env.*
- *.pem
- *.key

# --- The losing side of a conflict, kept whatever its name ---
# notes.conflict1.md passes on its extension, Makefile.conflict1 has none.
+ *.conflict[0-9]*

# --- Code ---
+ *.py
+ *.ipynb
+ *.r
+ *.rmd
+ *.sh
+ *.c
+ *.h
+ *.cpp
+ *.hpp
+ *.java
+ *.js
+ *.ts
+ *.html
+ *.css
+ *.sql
+ *.lua
+ *.rs
+ *.go
+ Makefile
+ Dockerfile
+ .gitignore

# --- Documents ---
+ *.pdf
+ *.txt
+ *.md
+ *.tex
+ *.bib
+ *.odt
+ *.ods
+ *.odp
+ *.docx
+ *.xlsx
+ *.pptx

# --- Configuration ---
+ *.toml
+ *.yaml
+ *.yml
+ *.json
+ *.ini
+ *.cfg

# --- Small data, under MAX_SIZE ---
+ *.csv
+ *.tsv

# --- Figures, under MAX_SIZE ---
+ *.png
+ *.jpg
+ *.jpeg
+ *.svg

# --- Nothing else ---
# Compiled objects, .pyc, parquet, npy, pkl, h5, model weights, archives, video.
- *
